{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_013gTkFSMc48VJnkzAzU81fe", "type": "tool_result", "content": "from flask import Blueprint, jsonify, request\n\nbp = Blueprint(\"checkout\", __name__)\n\n\n@bp.post(\"/checkout\")\ndef checkout():\n    cart = request.get_json()\n    total = sum(item[\"unit_cents\"] * item[\"quantity\"] for item in cart[\"items\"])\n    return jsonify({\"total_cents\": total, \"status\": \"pending\"})\n# ledgerline\n\nLedgerline is the invoicing and billing servce for Acme. It creates invoices,\ncomputes tax, posts finalized invoices to the external ledger, and exports\nmonthly reports.\n\n## Layout\n\n- `src/billing/` - money, invoices, refunds, and tax logic\n- `src/api/` - the HTTP endpoints\n- `migrations/` - the SQL schema migrations\n- `scripts/` - operational scripts\n\n## Development\n\nInstall the dependancies with `pip install -e .[dev]`, then run the tests.\nscripts/export.py:10:    bucket = os.environ.get(\"EXPORT_BUCKET\", \"ledgerline-exports-dev\")", "is_error": false}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "dc270454-511f-4f9f-807b-03ea00ea2c58", "uuid": "d2237648-a44e-4903-afcd-8e2cd5d356f5", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T13:05:52.129Z", "tool_use_result": {"stdout": "from flask import Blueprint, jsonify, request\n\nbp = Blueprint(\"checkout\", __name__)\n\n\n@bp.post(\"/checkout\")\ndef checkout():\n    cart = request.get_json()\n    total = sum(item[\"unit_cents\"] * item[\"quantity\"] for item in cart[\"items\"])\n    return jsonify({\"total_cents\": total, \"status\": \"pending\"})\n# ledgerline\n\nLedgerline is the invoicing and billing servce for Acme. It creates invoices,\ncomputes tax, posts finalized invoices to the external ledger, and exports\nmonthly reports.\n\n## Layout\n\n- `src/billing/` - money, invoices, refunds, and tax logic\n- `src/api/` - the HTTP endpoints\n- `migrations/` - the SQL schema migrations\n- `scripts/` - operational scripts\n\n## Development\n\nInstall the dependancies with `pip install -e .[dev]`, then run the tests.\nscripts/export.py:10:    bucket = os.environ.get(\"EXPORT_BUCKET\", \"ledgerline-exports-dev\")", "stderr": "", "interrupted": false, "isImage": false, "noOutputExpected": false}}
